  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goofat Tomato Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the project, the cooperative seeks to build its capacity to organize operations and find better markets for its producers. Producer members will benefit from the rehabilitation of existing wells and procurement of motor pumps, receive technical training, and sell their tomatoes and other various agricultural crops through the cooperative.</narrative>
  </description>
